    "prompt": "A backyard, rectangular in area, has a length 2 metres more than its width ($x$ metres). Inside the rectangle are three square paved areas each of area $5\\text{ m}^2$ as shown. The remaining area is lawn.\n\nFind an expression for the:",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [
      {
        "id": "p16-q9-diagram",
        "role": "question",
        "format": "tikz",
        "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"geometry\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[{\"name\":\"lawnFill\",\"hex\":\"DCEBE0\",\"reason\":\"identifies the lawn remaining outside the paved squares\"},{\"name\":\"pavingFill\",\"hex\":\"FCE8D5\",\"reason\":\"identifies the three equal paved areas excluded from the lawn\"}],\"reference\":\"source page 16, p16-q9-diagram\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1cm,y=1cm,line width=0.8pt]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\definecolor{lawnFill}{HTML}{DCEBE0}\n\\definecolor{pavingFill}{HTML}{FCE8D5}\n\\filldraw[fill=lawnFill,draw=black] (0,0) rectangle (6.6,3.2);\n\\filldraw[fill=pavingFill,draw=black] (0.7,0.95) rectangle (2,2.25);\n\\filldraw[fill=pavingFill,draw=black] (2.65,0.95) rectangle (3.95,2.25);\n\\filldraw[fill=pavingFill,draw=black] (4.6,0.95) rectangle (5.9,2.25);\n\\path (0,3.2) -- (6.6,3.2) node[midway,above,font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont,text=black] {$x+2$ metres};\n\\path (6.6,0) -- (6.6,3.2) node[midway,right,font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont,text=black] {$x$ metres};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
        "src": null,
        "widthMm": 70,
        "alt": "Mathematical diagram",
        "overlayOf": null,
        "transparent": false,
        "axes": null,
        "spec": {
          "sourcePage": 16,
          "sourceRegion": "Question 9 backyard diagram",
          "description": "Horizontal rectangle with three equal internal squares arranged left to right. Light green lawn and light orange paving distinguish the areas used in the calculation; all outlines and labels are black. Diagram proportions are illustrative.",
          "mathematics": "The backyard has length x+2 metres and width x metres. Each of the three paved squares has area 5 square metres.",
          "answerVisibility": "Only the supplied dimensions and area regions are visible; no calculated areas or factorisation appear."
        },
        "derived": false,
        "reviewStatus": "needs-review"
      }
    ],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p16-q9-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "total backyard area",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(x^2+2x)\\text{ m}^2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}A_{\\text{backyard}}&=x(x+2)\\\\&=x^2+2x\\text{ m}^2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "p16-q9-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "area of lawn in expanded form",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(x^2+2x-15)\\text{ m}^2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}A_{\\text{paving}}&=3\\times5\\\\&=15\\text{ m}^2\\\\A_{\\text{lawn}}&=x^2+2x-15\\text{ m}^2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p16-q9-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "area of lawn in factorised form",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(x+5)(x-3)\\text{ m}^2$",
          "worked": "$5+(-3)=2$ and $5\\times(-3)=-15$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}A_{\\text{lawn}}&=x^2+2x-15\\\\&=(x+5)(x-3)\\text{ m}^2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      }
    ],
